# Cloudflare Pages 响应头：安全 + 静态资源长缓存 + HSTS + CSP。
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://hm.baidu.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https://; connect-src 'self' https://www.google-analytics.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://hm.baidu.com; frame-ancestors 'self'

/.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=60

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
